pan style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  incomplete </span><span style=\"color:#008\">final</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> line found on </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;C:/....blah...&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FUN</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">X</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> line </span><span style=\"color:#008\">with</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Elapsed Time&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> found<br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">scan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">csvfiles</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> skip </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lineno</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> comment</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">char</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;#&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;,&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  data length </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">49148291</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#008\">sub</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">multiple </span><span style=\"color:#008\">or</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> multiple of the number of rows </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">843</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><br>I get the error above when trying to read the samples produced in cmdstan into R. Any suggestions?<br><br></div>"
    ]
