     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">On Thursday, July 30, 2015 at 11:52:56 AM UTC-4, Cody Ross wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks for the heads up on this.<br><br>Doesn&#39;t the cmdstan guide say that the VarInf and MCMC output follow almost the same form? They both are just samples of parameters right?<br><br>What is the difference in their structure?<br></div></blockquote></div>"
